# Simply Wall St

> Simply Wall St is an equity research platform covering listed companies worldwide. Each company has a stock report that turns financial data, analyst forecasts and filings into visual analysis, summarised by the Snowflake score across five dimensions: Valuation, Future Growth, Past Performance, Financial Health and Dividends.

Stock report URLs follow `https://simplywall.st/stocks/{country}/{sector}/{exchange}-{ticker}/{company-slug}`, for example https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/tech/nasdaq-aapl/apple. Each report has section pages under the same path: `/valuation`, `/future`, `/past`, `/health`, `/dividend`, `/management`, `/ownership` and `/information`. A full list of stock reports is in https://simplywall.st/sitemap.xml.

Content is general in nature and is not financial advice. Portfolio, watchlist and screener features require a free account; some data requires a paid plan.

## Research

- [Stock report example](https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/tech/nasdaq-aapl/apple): Snowflake summary, valuation, growth forecasts, financial health, dividends, ownership and management for a single company
- [Markets](https://simplywall.st/markets/us): market overview by country, with sector and industry breakdowns (replace `us` with a country code such as `au`, `gb`, `ca`, `in`, `de`, `jp`)
- [Market insights](https://simplywall.st/markets/insights): analyst commentary on global market events
- [Largest stocks by market cap](https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/market-cap-large): stock lists by country, sector and size
- [Investing ideas](https://simplywall.st/discover/investing-ideas): curated stock screens by theme, such as undervalued, high-dividend or AI stocks
- [Community narratives](https://simplywall.st/community/narratives): investor-written stories with fair value estimates for companies
- [News](https://simplywall.st/news): company and market news written from Simply Wall St analysis

